    <div class="alpheios-lex-entry" lemma-id="n17785" root="زعق" body-key="z">
    
      <b><span class="alpheios-lex-ar" lang="ara">زَاعِقٌ</span></b>  One <i>who calls out,</i> or <i>cries out, to his
beasts, and drives them away quickly:</i> or <i>who
drives them, and cries out to them vehemently.</i>
(TA.) [See also <span class="alpheios-lex-ar" lang="ara">زَعَّاقٌ</span>.]

